{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Into The Canvas&quot; is a cozy couch co-op game themed around paint. Both players must work together to overcome obstacles and complete 3 distinct levels. <br><br>By using the bucket to cover themselves in different coloured paint, the cat and mouse can platform, change their sizes or even glow in the dark! Each stage rethinks how paint can be used. The unlikely duo are on either side of the corridor based levels. So, they'll have to pass the paint bucket back and fourth between the two sides to help each other move closer to the end. <br><br>Take the game at your own pace, or try and beat the levels as fast as you can! Into The Canvas tracks your time taken to finish a level, as well as other criteria, which is displayed at the end of each stage.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005390?t=1760951300","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005390?t=1760951300","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005390/077c1a60f66e27f9c07f13b69dd3f153b87cbb7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760951300","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005390/077c1a60f66e27f9c07f13b69dd3f153b87cbb7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760951300","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Into The Canvas&quot; is a cozy couch co-op game themed around paint. Both players must work together to overcome obstacles and complete 3 distinct levels. <br><br>By using the bucket to cover themselves in different coloured paint, the cat and mouse can platform, change their sizes or even glow in the dark! Each stage rethinks how paint can be used. The unlikely duo are on either side of the corridor based levels. So, they'll have to pass the paint bucket back and fourth between the two sides to help each other move closer to the end. <br><br>Take the game at your own pace, or try and beat the levels as fast as you can! Into The Canvas tracks your time taken to finish a level, as well as other criteria, which is displayed at the end of each stage.</p>","developers":["Unconscious Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005390/6c33b4409ec4064d9ef76704f91d91e8f628fb60/header.jpg?t=1760951300","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4005390/727198354/6eaf81cf00a2ca9cf2540d1ca027745327b98ffa/1758394407/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758919213","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4005390/727198354/6eaf81cf00a2ca9cf2540d1ca027745327b98ffa/1758394407/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758919213","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4005390/727198354/6eaf81cf00a2ca9cf2540d1ca027745327b98ffa/1758394407/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758919213","id":257202947,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257202947/movie480.mp4?t=1758919213","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257202947/movie_max.mp4?t=1758919213"},"name":"Previe